              "text": "lūctuōsus, lūctuōsa, lūctuōsum — \"sorrowful, mournful\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ille diēs lūctuōsus omnibus cīvibus fuit. That day was a sorrowful one for all the citizens."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Built on lūctus — mourning. It can mean causing grief or feeling it."
            }
          ]
        },
