          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "lūctuōsus is built on lūctus \"mourning\", the noun of lūgeō \"to mourn\", with -ōsus \"full of\" (Lewis & Short; EtymDB derives it from lūctus)."
            }
          ]
        },
